 <office:body>
  <office:text>
   <text:p text:style-name="Right">避難者カード【中国語（簡体</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Title">避難者卡（正面）　　【様式－７】</text:p>
   <text:p><text:span text:style-name="Bold">填写日</text:span>　　年　　月　　日　　请每个家庭都填写一张。</text:p>
   <table:table table:name="FrontDetails" table:style-name="Tbl">
    <table:table-column table:style-name="ColA"/>
    <table:table-column table:style-name="ColB"/>
    <table:table-column table:style-name="ColC"/>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeavyCell"><text:p text:style-name="Bold">避難日期</text:p></table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">年　月　日　　点左右</text:p></table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeavyCell" table:number-rows-spanned="3"><text:p>居住组－No</text:p><text:p>1组－1～6</text:p></table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeavyCell"><text:p text:style-name="Bold">避難场所</text:p></table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>避难所　・　居家　・　其他　（　　）</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Right">※在车内住宿避难者请填写停车场的位置。</text:p></table:table-cell>
     <table:covered-table-cell table:style-name="HeavyCell"/>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeavyCell"><text:p text:style-name="Bold">自治会名称</text:p></table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>※如果未加入自治会，写上“未加入”</text:p></table:table-cell>
     <table:covered-table-cell table:style-name="HeavyCell"/>
    </table:table-row>
   </table:table>
   <table:table table:name="Residents" table:style-name="Tbl">
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Roster1"/>
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Roster2"/>
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Roster3"/>
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Roster4"/>
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Roster5"/>
    <table:table-column table:style-name="Roster6"/>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">在避难所的人打圈</text:p></table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">片假名读音</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Center">姓 名</text:p></table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">年龄</text:p></table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">性别</text:p></table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">关系</text:p></table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="HeadCell"><text:p>备注※需要照顾者号码以及需要照顾的地方</text:p></table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p>（代表者）</text:p></table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">岁</text:p></table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">男・女・其他</text:p></table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">岁</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">男・女・其他</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">岁</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">男・女・其他</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">岁</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">男・女・其他</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
    <table:table-row>
     <table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">岁</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">男・女・其他</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="RosterCell"><text:p/></table:table-cell>
    </table:table-row>
   </table:table>
   <table:table table:name="ContactAndNeeds" table:style-name="Tbl">
    <table:table-column table:style-name="InfoA"/><table:table-column table:style-name="InfoB"/>
    <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">地址</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>〒</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
    <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">代表者电话号码</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">（　　　　　　）</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
    <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">有无宠物</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>有　・　无　　※选「有」的，请接着填写宠物登记票。</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
    <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">需照顾者</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>1 孕产妇　　　2 婴幼儿　　　3 残疾人（　　）</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
   </table:table>
   <text:p text:style-name="PageBreak"/>
   <table:table table:name="CareContinuation" table:style-name="Tbl">
    <table:table-column table:style-name="InfoA"/><table:table-column table:style-name="InfoB"/>
    <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Bold">※请在备注栏填写所属号码</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>4 需要护理（　　）　　　5 使用医疗机械（　　）</text:p><text:p>6 过敏症（　　　　　　）　　　7 外国人（国籍　　　　　　）</text:p><text:p>8 其他（　　　　　　）</text:p><text:p>※需要照顾者指孕产妇、婴幼儿、残疾人等在避难生活中需要特别照顾的人士。</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
   </table:table>
   <text:p text:style-name="Title">避難者カード（背面）　　　　　　【様式－７】</text:p>
   <text:p text:style-name="Bold">背面内容可等状況安定后再填写。</text:p>
   <table:table table:name="BackForm" table:style-name="Tbl">
    <table:table-column table:style-name="InfoA"/><table:table-column table:style-name="InfoB"/>
    <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>为了确认安否而公开信息（请选择「希望」「不希望」的任意一个，并打○。）</text:p></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/></table:table-row>
    <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>您同意通过网页或报道机构等公开避难者（您的）信息吗？</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">希望・不希望</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
    <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>当亲戚、同个住所的人、朋友问及您的安否时，您同意提供避难者（您的）信息吗？</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">希望・不希望</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
    <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Bold">房屋受灾状况</text:p><text:p>※请在该当的选项上画圈。</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>有　・　无　　※选“有”后，请详细填写住房受害状况。</text:p><text:p>※填写例</text:p><text:p>・房子倒塌，近期内无法居住。</text:p><text:p>・室内收拾好后，可以回去居住。</text:p><text:p>停电　　　停水　　　煤气断了　　　电话不通</text:p><text:p>其他（　　　　　　　　　　　　　）</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
    <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Bold">伤病者信息</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>请填写姓名和具体的负伤、疾病状况。</text:p><text:p/><text:p/></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
    <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">收容场所</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Center">（送往机构）</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
    <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">收容场所信息</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Center">（送往机构地址）</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
    <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>特記事項（如果有有种资格等，可以提供合作的人士，请填写姓名和内容。）</text:p><text:p/><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/></table:table-row>
    <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell" table:number-columns-spanned="2"><text:p>＜避難所运营委员会填写栏＞</text:p><text:p/><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:covered-table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/></table:table-row>
    <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>退所年月日</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p text:style-name="Center">年　　月　　日</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
   </table:table>
   <text:p text:style-name="PageBreak"/>
   <table:table table:name="Departure" table:style-name="Tbl">
    <table:table-column table:style-name="InfoA"/><table:table-column table:style-name="InfoA"/><table:table-column table:style-name="InfoA"/><table:table-column table:style-name="InfoB"/>
    <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>退出后去向</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>电话</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p/></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
   </table:table>
   <text:p>为确保避难所的顺利运作，敬请各位避难人员（包括居家避难及车内避难人员）在力所能及的范围内协助参与避难所的管理与运营。</text:p>
  </office:text>
